<title>FINLAND: FINNISH FAZER '96 PROFIT BEFORE EXTRAS UP 16 PCT.</title>
<headline>FINNISH FAZER '96 PROFIT BEFORE EXTRAS UP 16 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to Dec 31,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items	    201 vs 174</p>
<p> Proposed dividend (markka)			40 vs 50</p>
<p> Net sales					  3,952 vs 3,920</p>
<p> Operating profit				   212 vs 208</p>
<p> Net profit					   133 vs 191</p>
<p> Equity-to-assets ratio (percent)		52 vs 44</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of privately-owned Finnish confectionery,</p>
<p>bakery and catering group is Oy Karl Fazer Ab.</p>
